.TH AD_PIPELINE 1 "2026-08-30" "ad 2.0" "ad pipeline"
.SH NAME
ad_pipeline \- run the full ad animation pipeline (compute, postprocess, pace, animate)
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B ad_pipeline
.RI [ options ]
.I <oldfile> <newfile>
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B ad_pipeline
is the end-to-end pipeline driver. It runs all four stages:
.PP
.RS
.nf
1. compute     — ad_compute (C++; Perl fallback)
2. postprocess — ad_postprocess (layer orchestrator)
3. pace        — ad_layer_pace (C; Perl fallback)
4. animate     — ad (C; Perl fallback)
.fi
.RE
.PP
Options are routed by prefix:
.TP
.B \-\-compute\-*
Options for ad_compute (e.g. \-\-compute\-algorithm patience)
.TP
.B \-\-postprocess\-*
Options for ad_postprocess (e.g. \-\-postprocess\-indent\-last)
.TP
.B \-\-pace\-*
Options for ad_layer_pace (e.g. \-\-pace\-delete\-pacing word)
.TP
.B \-\-animator\-*
Options for ad (e.g. \-\-animator\-no\-display, \-\-animator\-speed 2.0)
.PP
Unprefixed options (e.g. \-\-speed, \-\-no\-display) go to the animator.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-no\-display
Process without rendering (write snapshot only).
.TP
.B \-\-speed N
Speed multiplier (0.5=half, 2=double, 5=5x).
.TP
.B \-\-snapshot FILE
Write final buffer to FILE.
.TP
.B \-\-output FILE
Write result to FILE after animation.
.TP
.B \-\-indent\-last
Enable the indent_last layer.
.TP
.B \-\-overwrite
Enable the overwrite layer.
.TP
.B \-\-line\-delete\-in\-place
Enable the line_delete_in_place layer.
.TP
.B \-\-ad\-layer=NAME
Add a layer to the postprocess chain. Repeatable. See
.BR ad_postprocess (1).
.TP
.B \-\-ad\-layer\-path=DIR
Add a directory to the layer search path. Repeatable.
.TP
.B \-\-ad\-layer\-arg=LAYER:ARG
Pass ARG to LAYER only.
.TP
.B \-\-ad\-layer\-profile
Print per-layer timing to stderr.
.TP
.B \-\-ad\-layer\-dry\-run
Print the layer chain and exit without executing.
.TP
.B \-\-ad\-layer\-keep\-temps
Keep intermediate files for debugging.
.TP
.B \-\-list\-layers
List available layers and exit.
.TP
.B \-\-help, \-h
Show help and exit.
.SH CONFIGURATION
No environment variables. Use CLI flags or the config file at
$XDG_CONFIG_HOME/ad/config (defaults to ~/.config/ad/config).
.PP
Precedence: /etc/ad/config < ~/.config/ad/config < CLI flags.
.SH EXAMPLES
.TP
.B ad_pipeline old.py new.py
Run the full pipeline with defaults.
.TP
.B ad_pipeline --no-display --speed 5 --snapshot out.txt old.py new.py
Run fast, write result to out.txt.
.TP
.B ad_pipeline --indent-last --pacing gaussian old.py new.py
Enable indent_last and gaussian pacing.
.TP
.B ad_pipeline --ad-layer=my_custom_layer old.py new.py
Add a custom layer to the chain.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR ad_vim (1),
.BR ad_postprocess (1),
.BR ad_compute (1),
.BR ad (1)
